cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Omni Suite, please cite this software."
title: "Omni Suite"
abstract: "Omni Suite (OmniConverter Studio) is a browser-first, offline-capable toolkit for document, image, OCR, audio, video, archive, data-engineering, and database workflows. Browser-capable operations run locally in the browser; an optional loopback-only Local Engine provides native processing for specialist and large-file tasks."
